    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Tactics</strong> is a turn-based tactical game that blends the strategic depth of classic RPGs with the unpredictability and nuance of tabletop systems. Inspired by D&amp;D 5e rules, each battle is a challenge where positioning, abilities, and planning are just as important as brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical System</strong>: Control a team of heroes on maps, where every move can determine victory or defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Inspired by D&amp;D 5e</strong>: HP, MP, attacks, spells, potions, modifiers \u2014 all faithfully adapted from traditional RPG mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Level up, allocate attributes, learn new abilities, and shape your ideal tactical strategy.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Tactics</strong> is a turn-based tactical game that blends the strategic depth of classic RPGs with the unpredictability and nuance of tabletop systems. Inspired by D&amp;D 5e rules, each battle is a challenge where positioning, abilities, and planning are just as important as brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical System</strong>: Control a team of heroes on maps, where every move can determine victory or defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Inspired by D&amp;D 5e</strong>: HP, MP, attacks, spells, potions, modifiers \u2014 all faithfully adapted from traditional RPG mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Level up, allocate attributes, learn new abilities, and shape your ideal tactical strategy.</p></li></ul>",
